{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-18T10:02:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2001593791908843989"],"id":"2001593791908843989","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":30663,"like_count":62,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这个月一直忙到现在，终于有时间能开板了😂 https://t.co/dbaaq1LZWI","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2001593791908843989"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-17T04:48:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2001152495410929818"],"id":"2001152495410929818","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":16,"impression_count":111389,"like_count":133,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":0},"text":"刷X刷久了，\n感觉福利姬怎么什么东西都往b里塞？？？🧐","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2001152495410929818"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-17T02:35:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2001119029201920200"],"id":"2001119029201920200","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":51161,"like_count":59,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"私信聊天时，感觉这边满足不了你的需求，\n我这边就会直接建议你不要入会了，\n会员服务本身就是个双向选择，\n你可以选择加还是不加，\n我也可以选择让不让你加，\n我希望我的会员频道可以真的帮助喜欢各种夜生活，\n并可以勇于探索更有趣更刺激成人体验的人，\n而不是盲目的吸引一些只想约女优线下的人…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2001119029201920200"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-16T13:11:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2000916799928639987"],"id":"2000916799928639987","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":78,"impression_count":114419,"like_count":581,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":37,"retweet_count":9},"text":"在宫城县一个小镇里拍东西，\n进了一家小小的居酒屋，\n大家都围城一圈坐，\n彼此之间也可以聊聊天。\n我进去后大家先是惊讶为什么会有年轻人来这种全是满嘴方言老头子的店，\n后来一问我又开始惊讶，\n为什么会有中国人来这种店，\n然后在场两位老大爷突然就开始用又简单又标准的日语来跟我说话， https://t.co/LX4czEt2Nk","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2000916799928639987"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-15T23:06:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2000703921283874944"],"id":"2000703921283874944","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":123,"impression_count":451091,"like_count":553,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":47,"retweet_count":8},"text":"前几天来了一个新加坡大哥，说要看房。\n我说我帮你问问？\n他说不用，他小红书联系了不动产，\n我问他需要去机场接机吗？\n他说不用，有不动产来接他，\n然后大哥就被几家不动产中介拉着四处看房，\n出行吃饭全是各种中介买单，\n大哥也不言语就是默默的跟着蹭吃蹭喝，\n甚至有一天大哥找AV女优的钱，","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2000703921283874944"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-14T11:53:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2000172222166802726"],"id":"2000172222166802726","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":76,"impression_count":106853,"like_count":191,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":9},"text":"又听到一个中国人在日本赚钱的路子，\n简单地说就是一个老板过来拿古物商许可开中古店，\n然后把一块表放在店里，\n再找另外一个拿短期签证的人去免税买走，\n免税的部分俩人平分…\n就这样空手套掏日本的钱掏了一年多，\n在日本税务局开始调查的时候，\n打包跑去别的国家了…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2000172222166802726"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-13T13:49:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1999839191598055616"],"id":"1999839191598055616","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":136,"impression_count":662872,"like_count":1605,"quote_count":17,"reply_count":229,"retweet_count":39},"text":"中国人观光客少了，\n但日本人发现白人的素质更差…😂 https://t.co/QuNz6u47pV","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1999839191598055616"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-13T10:49:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1999793697932906892"],"id":"1999793697932906892","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":37,"impression_count":95498,"like_count":167,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":3},"text":"韩国和台湾的陪酒店，\n直接在房间里就可以给客人👄\n这在日本玩文的玩习惯了，\n到这虎狼之地整个人都变得腼腆起来…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1999793697932906892"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-12T06:45:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1999369933990559828"],"id":"1999369933990559828","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":70159,"like_count":76,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这次的的封号潮，\n让我想起了当年pubg的封号潮，\n网吧里有一个人开科技，\n一整个网吧的号都被封了…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1999369933990559828"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-12T04:37:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1999337807521939902"],"id":"1999337807521939902","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":57460,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"最近很多x的私信我都看不过来，为了保证每个人都能回复到，在资讯频道里开设了一个咨询专用的TG客服。以后有入会问题如果我x里没回复到的，就可以直接去频道里咨询。方便快捷。咨询频道入口见个人说明里。 https://t.co/17Ovqbui9M","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1999337807521939902"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-12T03:40:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1999323466424811738"],"id":"1999323466424811738","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":34129,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"不是每一个リフレ的女孩子都有内容的…\n我给你们分享哪一个女孩子可以有内容，\n但不代表她在的那家店所有女孩子都可以，\n我这不是也在一个一个人的去帮你们尝试吗…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1999323466424811738"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-11T05:10:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998983819366641945"],"id":"1998983819366641945","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":72,"impression_count":51621,"like_count":292,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":20},"text":"多年总结的经验，\n能花钱搞定的事情，绝对不要欠人情，\n能花钱睡到的，绝对不要谈感情。\n能让你免费睡的，后面会花的更多… https://t.co/KT2aC03nwA","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998983819366641945"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-10T10:28:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998701385387303085"],"id":"1998701385387303085","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":38660,"like_count":69,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"text":"又来国分町了，属于仙台人民的歌舞伎町☺️ https://t.co/T7vWGHxb9z","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998701385387303085"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-09T15:36:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998416353687183603"],"id":"1998416353687183603","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":38687,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"你们一直催我更的台湾红灯区纪行，\n帮你们写好发会员频道了… https://t.co/dRzq8rYr2A","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998416353687183603"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-09T09:58:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998331315326980550"],"id":"1998331315326980550","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":73,"impression_count":60502,"like_count":157,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":4},"text":"我身边确实有很多在日本钻空子的华人，\n有的是为了赚钱，有的是为了签证，\n有的是为了育儿，有的是为了工作便利，\n主要日本确实能钻的漏洞实在太多了，\n我也是有时候感觉他们有些钻空子的方法很有意思，\n就会在X上分享一下，\n至于你们是否想模仿他们的这些钻空子方法，\n完全取决于你们自己…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998331315326980550"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-09T03:34:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998234893273428067"],"id":"1998234893273428067","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":754,"impression_count":537792,"like_count":1280,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":93},"text":"国内某一平台超过10万粉丝的网红，\n居然可以申请日本的艺术签证，\n身边一个客户买了一个十几万粉的抖音账号，\n用那个账号经过一系列运作就申请下来日本的艺术签证，\n很多人还在愁经营管理签证收紧的事，\n在我看来日本的搞签证方案还是很多的嘛…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998234893273428067"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-09T03:06:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998227619192750211"],"id":"1998227619192750211","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":69272,"like_count":74,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1998214465855361237","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这么一看，还是做我这种网黄比较好，\n碰到仙人跳只能算是日常工作中的不断试错…\n人生难就难在用一个高尚的光环，\n套住了自己的快乐… https://t.co/LUtOaVdXcQ","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998227619192750211"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-09T02:13:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998214465855361237"],"id":"1998214465855361237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":113,"impression_count":2482043,"like_count":986,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":246,"retweet_count":11},"text":"蓝战非那事，怎么看怎么像遇到仙人跳了然后找借口弥补…🤨","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998214465855361237"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-08T14:22:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998035407255244856"],"id":"1998035407255244856","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":46017,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这次青森地震好大…😟","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1998035407255244856"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-08T09:06:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1997955888527937613"],"id":"1997955888527937613","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":29,"impression_count":68290,"like_count":195,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":4},"text":"认识一搞IT的哥们羡慕一些做线下的妹子腿一张就能赚钱，\n其实各自人生都差不多，\n谁也不必羡慕谁，\n28岁以后还做不了项目经理，\n28岁以后还自己接单，管理不了女孩\n那基本人生也就那样了…\n做线下的赚的多但花的也多啊，\n做IT的赚的多但攒的也多啊，\n尽管攒的那些早晚都是给做线下的准备的…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1997955888527937613"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-06T04:04:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1997155055808709100"],"id":"1997155055808709100","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":35339,"like_count":110,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"回东京了，\n台湾的夜，挺有意思，可以常去。 https://t.co/vSu9Wwg6i8","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1997155055808709100"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-05T12:59:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1996927420063240413"],"id":"1996927420063240413","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":70895,"like_count":178,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":0},"text":"總算見到@fingermaster56 跟男人一起合影了，\n成人話題果然還是和懂行的人一起聊有意思😂 https://t.co/0Ahj3kJdHw","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1996927420063240413"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-05T06:23:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1996827871822967079"],"id":"1996827871822967079","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":47340,"like_count":57,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"日本风俗店铺就是这样，\n你放他一次鸽子，或是某一次不守规矩，\n那么你就再也进不了这家店了。\n同时很多店铺都是连锁店，\n一家把你拉黑了，\n整个group的都会给你拉黑。\n不过没关系，\n还有几千家店铺等着你们去祸害呢😂\n等我回日本再给会员准备一批私人专享的cityheaven账号吧。 https://t.co/yLS6nlzUWG","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1996827871822967079"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-05T05:21:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1996812267653157235"],"id":"1996812267653157235","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":31674,"like_count":111,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"台湾就给人感觉，活的很安逸…\n下次时间充裕一定要去高雄台南那边走一走 https://t.co/KyOteBkVHU","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1996812267653157235"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-04T14:09:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1996582700036280768"],"id":"1996582700036280768","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":183914,"like_count":93,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"說真的我是感覺色情產業可以衍生出來的產業鏈真的有很多，\n人類剛需的錢是賺不完的，\n但光靠拍攝光靠做線下能賺的還是太有限了，\n只要把眼光放長遠就能發現更多的商機。😊 https://t.co/mRWMfWZ9rJ","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/1996582700036280768"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2025-12-09T02:13:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1998214465855361237"],"id":"1998214465855361237","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":113,"impression_count":2482043,"like_count":986,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":246,"retweet_count":11},"text":"蓝战非那事，怎么看怎么像遇到仙人跳了然后找借口弥补…🤨"}],"users":[{"id":"222316578","name":"梁","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772826334999502848/ZdX2uBog_normal.jpg","username":"iam678","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2001593791908843989","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3fscn720xwd63igcemmwqr1n70df8u5","oldest_id":"1996582700036280768","result_count":25}}